<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />

  <!-- Mobile -->
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

  <!-- SEO -->
  <title>FLOW — Make wealth move.</title>
  <meta
    name="description"
    content="FLOW is a community-powered vision for voluntarily passing crypto opportunity forward. Built around the Bittensor ecosystem."
  />

  <!-- Open Graph / X preview -->
  <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
  <meta property="og:title" content="FLOW — Make wealth move." />
  <meta
    property="og:description"
    content="What if crypto winners shared a fraction of their upside to create new opportunities?"
  />
  <meta property="og:image" content="https://YOUR-DOMAIN.com/og-image.png" />

  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
  <meta name="twitter:title" content="FLOW — Make wealth move." />
  <meta
    name="twitter:description"
    content="A vision for making crypto opportunity circulate."
  />
  <meta name="twitter:image" content="https://YOUR-DOMAIN.com/og-image.png" />

  <meta name="theme-color" content="#0B0D10" />

  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0b0d10;
      --surface: #11151a;
      --surface-2: #151a20;
      --text: #f4f3ef;
      --muted: #929aa4;
      --line: #252b32;
      --accent: #ff9d2e;
      --accent-soft: rgba(255, 157, 46, 0.12);
      --max: 1120px;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family:
        Inter,
        -apple-system,
        BlinkMacSystemFont,
        "Segoe UI",
        Roboto,
        Helvetica,
        Arial,
        sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.5;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    a {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .container {
      width: min(var(--max), calc(100% - 40px));
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    /* =========================
       NAV
    ========================= */

    nav {
      height: 78px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .logo {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    }

    .logo-mark {
      width: 34px;
      height: 34px;
      border: 1px solid #343b44;
      border-radius: 50%;
      position: relative;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .logo-mark::before,
    .logo-mark::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      width: 13px;
      height: 13px;
      border: 2px solid var(--accent);
      border-radius: 50%;
    }

    .logo-mark::before {
      left: 4px;
    }

    .logo-mark::after {
      right: 4px;
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 28px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .nav-links a:hover {
      color: var(--text);
    }

    /* =========================
       HERO
    ========================= */

    .hero {
      min-height: 720px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      position: relative;
      padding: 100px 0;
    }

    .hero::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      width: 650px;
      height: 650px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--accent-soft);
      filter: blur(100px);
      top: 50%;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .hero-content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      max-width: 900px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      color: var(--accent);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(58px, 10vw, 118px);
      line-height: 0.9;
      letter-spacing: -0.07em;
      font-weight: 850;
      margin-bottom: 34px;
    }

    .hero-description {
      max-width: 760px;
      font-size: clamp(20px, 3vw, 30px);
      line-height: 1.25;
      color: #d5d8dc;
      letter-spacing: -0.025em;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .hero-buttons {
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 14px 20px;
      border-radius: 9px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 750;
      transition: 0.2s ease;
    }

    .button-primary {
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #101010;
      border-color: var(--accent);
    }

    .button-primary:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .button-secondary:hover {
      border-color: #555d67;
    }

    /* =========================
       MANIFESTO
    ========================= */

    .manifesto {
      padding: 120px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .manifesto h2 {
      max-width: 950px;
      font-size: clamp(40px, 7vw, 78px);
      line-height: 0.98;
      letter-spacing: -0.06em;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .highlight {
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    /* =========================
       PILLARS
    ========================= */

    .section {
      padding: 120px 0;
    }

    .section-label {
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: clamp(38px, 6vw, 64px);
      line-height: 1;
      letter-spacing: -0.055em;
      max-width: 800px;
      margin-bottom: 55px;
    }

    .cards {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .card {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 28px;
      min-height: 245px;
      transition:
        transform 0.25s ease,
        border-color 0.25s ease;
    }

    .card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      border-color: #414953;
    }

    .card-number {
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 48px;
    }

    .card h3 {
      font-size: 25px;
      letter-spacing: -0.035em;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .card p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* =========================
       CYCLE
    ========================= */

    .cycle-wrapper {
      margin-top: 30px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 18px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .cycle {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
    }

    .cycle-step {
      background: var(--surface);
      padding: 30px 22px;
      border-right: 1px solid var(--line);
      min-height: 160px;
    }

    .cycle-step:last-child {
      border-right: none;
    }

    .cycle-step strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 19px;
      margin-bottom: 9px;
    }

    .cycle-step span {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .arrow {
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: 12px;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }

    /* =========================
       TAO
    ========================= */

    .tao-section {
      background: var(--surface);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .tao-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 80px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .tao-grid h2 {
      font-size: clamp(40px, 6vw, 70px);
      line-height: 0.98;
      letter-spacing: -0.055em;
    }

    .tao-copy {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.65;
    }

    .tao-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 28px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 100px;
      padding: 10px 15px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 750;
    }

    .tao-dot {
      width: 9px;
      height: 9px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--accent);
    }

    /* =========================
       PRINCIPLES
    ========================= */

    .principles {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .principle {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 25px;
    }

    .principle strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      font-size: 17px;
    }

    .principle span {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    /* =========================
       CTA
    ========================= */

    .final-cta {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 150px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .final-cta h2 {
      font-size: clamp(48px, 8vw, 90px);
      line-height: 0.95;
      letter-spacing: -0.065em;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .final-cta p {
      color: var(--muted);
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto 35px;
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    /* =========================
       DISCLAIMER
    ========================= */

    .disclaimer {
      padding: 25px;
      border: 1px solid #3a3022;
      background: #15130f;
      border-radius: 14px;
      color: #b8ad9e;
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* =========================
       FOOTER
    ========================= */

    footer {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding: 35px 0 55px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 20px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    /* =========================
       RESPONSIVE
    ========================= */

    @media (max-width: 800px) {
      .container {
        width: min(100% - 32px, var(--max));
      }

      .nav-links {
        display: none;
      }

      .hero {
        min-height: 650px;
        padding: 80px 0;
      }

      .cards {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .cycle {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .cycle-step {
        border-right: none;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      }

      .cycle-step:last-child {
        border-bottom: none;
      }

      .tao-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 35px;
      }

      .principles {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .manifesto,
      .section {
        padding: 80px 0;
      }

      .final-cta {
        padding: 100px 0;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <div class="container">

    <!-- NAVIGATION -->
    <nav>
      <a href="#" class="logo">
        <span class="logo-mark"></span>
        FLOW
      </a>

      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="#vision">Vision</a>
        <a href="#cycle">The Cycle</a>
        <a href="#tao">TAO</a>
        <a href="#principles">Principles</a>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class="hero">

      <div class="hero-content">

        <div class="eyebrow">
          Built around the Bittensor ecosystem
        </div>

        <h1>
          Make wealth move.
        </h1>

        <p class="hero-description">
          Crypto created a new generation of winners.
          FLOW is a vision for helping create the next one —
          by making voluntary crypto opportunity circulate.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-buttons">
          <a href="#vision" class="button button-primary">
            Explore the idea
          </a>

          <a href="#cycle" class="button button-secondary">
            See the cycle ↓
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- MANIFESTO -->
    <section id="vision" class="manifesto">

      <h2>
        Not giving away the bag.<br>
        <span class="highlight">Sharing the upside.</span>
      </h2>

    </section>


    <!-- HOW IT WORKS -->
    <section class="section">

      <div class="section-label">
        The idea
      </div>

      <h2 class="section-title">
        Turn individual success into collective opportunity.
      </h2>

      <div class="cards">

        <article class="card">
          <div class="card-number">
            01 / SHARE
          </div>

          <h3>
            Give
          </h3>

          <p>
            Successful participants voluntarily contribute
            a fraction of their gains to a transparent community pool.
          </p>
        </article>


        <article class="card">
          <div class="card-number">
            02 / START
          </div>

          <h3>
            Opportunity
          </h3>

          <p>
            New participants can receive limited allocations
            designed to help them take their first responsible step.
          </p>
        </article>


        <article class="card">
          <div class="card-number">
            03 / GROW
          </div>

          <h3>
            Give back
          </h3>

          <p>
            There is no obligation to repay anyone.
            If a recipient eventually succeeds,
            they can choose to pass opportunity forward.
          </p>
        </article>

      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- THE CYCLE -->
    <section id="cycle" class="section">

      <div class="section-label">
        The flywheel
      </div>

      <h2 class="section-title">
        One contribution can create another opportunity.
      </h2>

      <div class="cycle-wrapper">

        <div class="cycle">

          <div class="cycle-step">
            <strong>WIN</strong>
            <span>Someone succeeds.</span>
            <div class="arrow">01</div>
          </div>

          <div class="cycle-step">
            <strong>SHARE</strong>
            <span>They voluntarily contribute.</span>
            <div class="arrow">02</div>
          </div>

          <div class="cycle-step">
            <strong>START</strong>
            <span>Someone gets a new opportunity.</span>
            <div class="arrow">03</div>
          </div>

          <div class="cycle-step">
            <strong>GROW</strong>
            <span>They learn and build.</span>
            <div class="arrow">04</div>
          </div>

          <div class="cycle-step">
            <strong>REPEAT</strong>
            <span>Success can circulate.</span>
            <div class="arrow">05</div>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- TAO -->
    <section id="tao" class="section tao-section">

      <div class="tao-grid">

        <div>
          <div class="section-label">
            First ecosystem
          </div>

          <h2>
            Start with<br>
            Bittensor.
          </h2>
        </div>

        <div>

          <p class="tao-copy">
            FLOW begins as a focused concept around
            the Bittensor ecosystem and $TAO.
          </p>

          <p class="tao-copy" style="margin-top: 20px;">
            The goal isn't another speculative token.
            It's a transparent layer for voluntarily
            passing opportunity forward.
          </p>

          <div class="tao-badge">
            <span class="tao-dot"></span>
            Built around $TAO
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- PRINCIPLES -->
    <section id="principles" class="section">

      <div class="section-label">
        Principles
      </div>

      <h2 class="section-title">
        Built around trust, transparency and voluntary participation.
      </h2>

      <div class="principles">

        <div class="principle">
          <strong>Non-custodial</strong>
          <span>
            Users should control their own assets.
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="principle">
          <strong>No guaranteed returns</strong>
          <span>
            FLOW does not promise investment performance.
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="principle">
          <strong>No recruitment rewards</strong>
          <span>
            Receiving an allocation never requires recruiting others.
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="principle">
          <strong>Transparent</strong>
          <span>
            Contributions and allocations should be verifiable.
          </span>
        </div>

      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- FINAL CTA -->
    <section class="final-cta">

      <div class="eyebrow">
        The vision
      </div>

      <h2>
        Your success<br>
        can start someone else's.
      </h2>

      <p>
        FLOW is an early-stage concept.
        The mission is simple:
        make crypto opportunity move.
      </p>

      <a href="#vision" class="button button-primary">
        Follow the idea
      </a>

    </section>


    <!-- DISCLAIMER -->
    <section style="padding-bottom: 80px;">

      <div class="disclaimer">

        <strong>Concept / prototype.</strong><br><br>

        FLOW is an early-stage concept and does not constitute
        investment advice, a promise of returns, or an offer
        of financial services. No participant is required to
        contribute, recruit others, or generate a return.
        Any future implementation involving crypto-assets
        would need to comply with applicable laws and regulations.

      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- FOOTER -->
    <footer>

      <span>
        FLOW — Make wealth move.
      </span>

      <span>
        Concept v0.1 · $TAO · Non-custodial by design
      </span>

    </footer>

  </div>

</body>
</html>
